Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Earth, 70 million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were sent here by a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii has looked for Okarin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,in many, many, many worldlines, chasing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say that the Okarin here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of many Okarins, but you could say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,he's the original Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You could also say the Mayushii here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of many Mayushiis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but that she's the original too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Okarin and Mayushii are gonna die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,our legacy{wills} will carry on to the Okarin and Mayushii in Akihabara,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,70 million years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it's okay.
