Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could hold this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Keep it spread out like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That ribbon's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to try it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have some cosplay outfits for ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosplay, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wear this in public...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We were racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:03:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're finished too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a time leap machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like an evil organization's brainwashing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a little PhoneWave, now with headphones!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not look like much,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but theoretically, this can transmit memories into the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...especially now that we can use the LHC.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The LHC's involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's basically a problem of compression.
Comment: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:41.22,Sign12A,,0,0,0,,Me on 2010/8/13 AD          Hippocampus
