Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Like putting a mattress that won't fit in a closet inside a compression bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Strictly speaking, it's different,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's close enough for you to get an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like using D-Mail, we can send data to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we use the cell phone's spread-spectrum waves to copy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the future memories to the brain in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This creates a "you" with memories from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The furthest back you can send data is 48 hours at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Any further and the two brain states'
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,difference is too large,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and it might fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's one other problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the PhoneWave or D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we need a test subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,or we can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're sending memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way to know if it succeeded
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,is to use a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:06:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, one of us has to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, tell me what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Hououin... but Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know why the line connected to SERN, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's nothing to indicate the hacking's been discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If they'd really noticed, they would've done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:29.24,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\q2\b1\bord0\fs270\blur4.5\c&HB79493&\frz9.101\3c&H6C5154&\pos(-176.4,608.4)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really overcome time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of me wants to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,can't Mayushii buy some bananas,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can time leap the bananas Mayushii bought?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, I explained it, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bananas have no memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But we won't do the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll announce this to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give the time leap machine to an appropriate organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii really agrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida ordered pizza, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just make the salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll need...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You said salad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, grapefruit salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why do we have fermented soybeans and ground beef in the cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make some good stuff by combining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The grapefruit is sour, so you can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,combine anything with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see once you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want salad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a complete salad right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's 50% off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no fun buying something that's already made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why guys who are only interested in experiments suck...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here's the coriander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's agent has finally made her move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Send help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a cat who just left the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face says, "I'm free at last!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected you to say we were starting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the time leap experiment immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On a fundamental level, humans are temporal creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Heidegger said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was relieved when you said we wouldn't do the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think everyone else agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, if we're having a party,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}can I call Luka and Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a developers' conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri might have been thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that we should've stopped for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:08:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, she may have seen more than the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,since we've been obsessed with the experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When do we announce it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner the better, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to contact my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...my dad will also find out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that I made a time leap machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we won't be able to go to Aomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be big.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll solve my lab mems' problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want to abuse me as your assistant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my dear companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might have a fever
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're saying un-assistant-like things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not particularly grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just being polite...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How tsundere can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tsundere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You always, and I mean always, say the craziest stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you're talking about companions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I never waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lab mems are my allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and the world is my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stunned I can't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You just spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to trip me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Snacking while everyone's out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pizza doesn't taste good cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, why are all three of them the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My personal tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're the boss now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right to buy the ingredients, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second. I'll get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I did! With all my might! With all I had!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, you said you'd protect your lab mems, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still possible
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the apple pie was just a failed attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and normally...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot the radishes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess sweet pickles'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When this meal's over, I'm going to retire and get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? I smell something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The pizza's here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my chic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Makise Kurisu here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:12:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu, did something happen between you and Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She just keeps blaming me for the craziest stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She said I'm a SERN spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crazy. It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know more about you than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you really are,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and what you're going to do after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Hououin Kyouma can handle this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised you better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't raise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what the most important thing is about being a mad scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening, and I won't be a mad scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-Time Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned Okabe Rintaro, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware of Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you believed her, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't tell me I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you making things worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You know—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii... doesn't like fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't really like it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When we're all together...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it'd be more fun if we were all friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that card a link?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-Time Warrior, your fate as a warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and the last slice of cake rest on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When in doubt, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my motto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell for it, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have three viruses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll give you the cherry on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Amane is taking this too seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, you're being mean to Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world of games, it's do or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I was raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones lined up in the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,are definitely link cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing Okabe's personality, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my assistant, yet you betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop calling me your assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that arrogance of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I won't thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii will help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then would you get tea for everyone, Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is happy you became friends with Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not really friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When we're all together, it's more fun to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking with Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be the one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,with the clearest view of the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the only time I've seen Okabe look so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insulting to Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Part-Time Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You won, but not of your own ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so arrogant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off to plan for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the last dessert of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go check on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:16:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cyalume Saber is Future Gadget #6.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use it as a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The pizza was good,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and Suzu and Kurisu were having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've got lots of lab mems now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was thinking that, lately, we've been lacking a bunch of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, chairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And we need more utensils...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we announce we've made a time leap machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll get some kind of reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll solve everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We can buy chairs and utensils?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I said we could buy those and still have money left over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a microwave too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss being able to heat up my chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked really lonely in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab was always quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All I could hear was the sound of your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And now there's Daru, Kurisu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka, Suzu, Moeka,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris, Mr. Braun, and Nae...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Mayushii isn't your hostage anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin! Mayushii!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The trains stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:25.33,SignDerp,,0,0,0,,{\be5\fs48\bord3\c&HC9E0C6&\3c&HB0AA94&\pos(1275,894)}Bomb threat? Akihabara in panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For those of you just tuning in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the following lines have been shut down due to a bomb threat:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamanote Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Soubu Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A bomb threat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This party was to celebrate the time leap machine's completion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why mention that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still hacking into SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that I went deeper.{teehee}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a direct connection to SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! You need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do, Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a taxi home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I don't have the money for a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch stopped working...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.47,0:20:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...have been suspended...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN will take the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Itaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you will come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For FB... FB... FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell{fuck} is this?!
